-- L0561 | D:/EclipseWorkspace/Parctice/PMS/PMS-struts/config-ibaits/sql-map-project-config.xml:3351 | query_contract_info | pm_project_property_from_sms
<![CDATA[
            SELECT DISTINCT a.`contractNo` , IFNULL(IF(a.salesType = '01', a.`projectName`, b.projectName), a.projectName) as projectName ,a.`customerName` ,a.`orderCreateTime` , b.`marketName` , b.`salesManName` FROM `pm_order_data_from_sap` a 
            LEFT JOIN  pm_project_property_from_sms b ON a.`orderExecNumber` = b.`orderExecNumber` 
